*** Executing all the combinations that can be run within a single
*** Binlog Server run.

*** 'fresh' state that is expected to fail (none of these attempts
***  will populate the authentication cache).

*** Populating the authentication cache.

*** 'authenticated' state that is expected to succeed or fail
***  (none of these attempts will change the authentication cache).

*** Executing every combination expected to succeed in the 'fresh'
*** state within its own Binlog Server run (so that each one starts
*** with an empty authentication cache).

